      "statement": "The knowledge lifecycle separates raw intake, normalized sources, AI-generated `_drafts/`, human approval, and canonical `concepts/`; the new-source process is prohibited from modifying `concepts/` and candidate knowledge must remain in `_drafts/` until promotion.",
